    "identifier": "uzumaki-mutation-dattebayo",
    "description": "<p>15th Level Clan Feature</p>\n<p>Mutated Feature: Spiraling Chains</p>\n<p>You never know when to give up. You’re not even sure if you know what that means. Every challenge is something you rise to. Believe it.</p>\n<p>When you roll a natural 20, on any d20 based roll, while in combat you regain 1 Spiral Cell. Additionally, when you would fail a d20 based roll, you can spend 2 Spiral Cells to remake the failed roll, gaining a rank of Mastery to the new result.</p>",
